<title>USA: TABLE - GPU Inc Q2 net eased.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GPU Inc Q2 net eased.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			 70,249		   73,625</p>
<p> Revs		     927,264		  912,254</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,952		  120,700</p>
<p> Sales in GWH	     9,933		    9,858</p>
<p>		     First Half</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.86		    $1.51</p>
<p> Net			225,287		  181,878</p>
<p> Revs		   1,969,328		1,935,188</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,921		  120,670</p>
<p> Sales in GWH	    21,111		   21,242</p>
<p>		     12 Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.82		    $4.12</p>
<p> Net			341,761		  485,536</p>
<p> Revs		   3,952,229		3,961,224</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,868		  118,778</p>
<p> Sales in GWH	    42,282		  118,778</p>
<p>NOTES: Net and revenues figues in thousands of dollars.</p>
<p>Gigawatt-hour (GWH) sales exclude interchange sales.</p>
<p>1997 12 month net includes charge of $74.5 million, or $0.62/shr, for costs related to retirement program.</p>
<p>1997 12 month net includes  credit of $104.9 million, or $0.91/shr, for reversal of previous TMI-2 write off parlially offset by charge of $8.4 million, or $0.07/shr, for TMI-2 monitored storage costs.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
